snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:30:#    marker color and hole-count parity. Every sample repeats the same odd hole count across all four\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:52:#    different markers share the same topology, showing that marker color also matters.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:56:#    ordering cues based on numeric color ids. One fill/marker color overlap may exist globally due\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:70:#     non-grey cells share one marker color; the generator only emits hole-bearing sprites and colors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:73:#     unique marker colors in the legend.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:254:      marker color that can appear around enclosed holes on workspace sprites.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:256:      marker color from the legend's right column.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:259:    - Read the legend as two groups of two rows. A sprite first matches a row by the marker color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:263:    - Recolor the entire sprite to that resolved color. Sprites whose marker color is not listed in\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:603:    \"\"\"Recolor all hole-adjacent sprite cells with the marker color.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/24/code.py:731:      - multi_output_markers: marker colors that appear on both odd and even matched sprites and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/0/code.py:222:    - The lower-left corner contains a vertical 2-column legend whose rows encode (marker color, fill color).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/0/code.py:223:    - Away from the legend, each marker color appears either as two opposite L-corners of a rectangle or as a solid 2x2 block.\n/home/li