4:#    Each active row/column still contains exactly one repeating marker color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D16/1/code.py:33:#    marker color 2 at positions 0 and 3, companion color 6 at position 6.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D16/1/code.py:90:    - On each active shooting-direction line, one marker color appears exactly\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D16/1/code.py:99:      the marker color, as in the original task.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D16/1/code.py:101:      the shooting edge and the companion use the marker color, and the beat at\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D14/0/code.py:35:#    The generator uses 1-3 marker colors per active line, with at least one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D14/0/code.py:43:#    - \"a companion is any aligned non-marker color\" fails, because another\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D14/0/code.py:61:#    Every grid contains at least one line with 2+ marker colors, and later\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/3/code.py:40:#   The mix color is chosen distinct from bg, all marker colors, and all fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/3/code.py:243:    - Non-legend pixels of a marker color form either two L-shaped opposite corners of a bounding box or one solid 2x2 block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/3/code.py:247:    - Read the legend bottom-to-top and locate all non-legend pixels of that marker color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D3/0/code.py:21:#     - Each active line still has exactly one repeated marker color with exactly two dots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D3/0/code.py:26:#     - Phase is anchored at the shooting-edge marker: beat index 0 uses the marker color,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D3/0/code.py:113:    - Without a companion, fill every beat position on the whole line with the marker color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/